<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, youngblood! Come here, come\nhere.\rYou new in Mahogany? I can tell. You\ngotta try a FIRE RageCandyBar!\rFresh! Homemade! In a back room! Just\n$300! Want one? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t get mad after you bought one,\nbut...\rBuyin’ a RageCandyBar don’t mean I’ma\nlet you through here.\r...Johto got mad places to see! Like\nthe Lighthouse in Olivine, the\fPharmacy in Cianwood...\rWhy don’t you go sightseein’? FAR from\nhere? Like, real far?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t get mad after you bought one,\nbut...\rBuyin’ a RageCandyBar don’t mean I’ma\nlet you through here.\r...Johto got mad places to see! Like\nthe Lighthouse in Olivine, the\fPharmacy in Cianwood...\rWhy don’t you go sightseein’? FAR from\nhere? Like, real far?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What? RageCandyBar? You want\nANOTHER? Somebody hooked!\rRight on! Same price, $300! Want one? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What? RageCandyBar? Another one?\rNah, one is enough for you.\nThese is STRONG, baby.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Somebody came all the way from Kanto\nfor one of these once.\rI ain’t have none in stock. They left\nHEATED. Cussin’. Kickin’ stuff.\rThese bars got a FOLLOWING, baby.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Somebody came all the way from Kanto\nfor one of these once.\rI ain’t have none in stock. They left\nHEATED. Cussin’. Kickin’ stuff.\rThese bars got a FOLLOWING, baby.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ain’t got enough bread.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ain’t got enough bread.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, fine then... Your loss.\nI’ll be here. I’m always here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, fine then... Your loss.\nI’ll be here. I’m always here.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00011" index="11">
