	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You seen this guy in a black cape?\rHe keep goin’ back and forth to the\nLake of Rage talkin’ about “radio\fwaves.”\rWho wear a CAPE in 2009? Who IS he,\nfr?\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You goin’ to see the GYARADOS wildin’\nat the lake? It’s like a nature\fdocumentary\fbut everybody screamin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The MAGIKARP came back to the lake!\rThe fishermen cryin’ happy tears.\nThe MAGIKARP still useless though.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Go to Grandma’s shop. She sell stuff\nnobody else got...\rYou wanna buy stuff, right?\nSo buy stuff at Grandma’s! Don’t ask\fwhat’s downstairs!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mahogany Town\nHome of the Ninja. Shh.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just a Souvenir Shop\rNothin’ Suspicious About It\nDefinitely Not a Fed Front</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0620_T28_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mahogany Town Block\nBoss: Pryce\fThe Old Head of Winter. Cold Hearted.</language>
	</row>
</body>
